      "source": [
        "## 2. Model PD dan validasi\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Split:** 70% development, 30% validation, stratified berdasarkan target.\n",
        "- **Champion: logistic regression.** Outlier dipotong di persentil 99 data development, data kosong diisi median plus missing flag, transformasi `log1p`, lalu standardisasi. Koefisiennya bisa dibaca dan diuji, karena itu bank masih memilihnya.\n",
        "- **Challenger: gradient boosting** pada fitur mentah. Kalau hanya sedikit lebih baik, model yang mudah dibaca tetap dipakai."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 3,
      "id": "aad9732f",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-11T14:45:01.807935Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-11T14:45:01.807593Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.937623Z",
          "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.935736Z"
        },
        "id": "aad9732f"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "X_dev, X_val, y_dev, y_val = train_test_split(gm, y, test_size=P[\"test_size\"], stratify=y, random_state=P[\"seed\"])\n",
        "cap = X_dev.quantile(0.99)                                          # batas outlier dari data development saja\n",
        "logit = make_pipeline(FunctionTransformer(lambda X: X.clip(lower=0, upper=cap, axis=1)),\n",
        "                      SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\", add_indicator=True),\n",
        "                      FunctionTransformer(np.log1p), StandardScaler(), LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000))\n",
        "gbm = HistGradientBoostingClassifier(learning_rate=0.05, max_iter=500, early_stopping=True, random_state=P[\"seed\"])\n",
        "models = {\"Logistik\": logit.fit(X_dev, y_dev), \"Gradient boosting\": gbm.fit(X_dev, y_dev)}\n",
        "p_dev = {k: m.predict_proba(X_dev)[:, 1] for k, m in models.items()}\n",
        "p_val = {k: m.predict_proba(X_val)[:, 1] for k, m in models.items()}\n",
        "\n",
        "def validasi(y, p):\n",
        "    fpr, tpr, _ = roc_curve(y, p)\n",
        "    auc = roc_auc_score(y, p)\n",
        "    return pd.Series({\"AUC\": auc, \"Gini\": 2 * auc - 1, \"KS\": (tpr - fpr).max(), \"Brier\": brier_score_loss(y, p),\n",
        "                      \"PD rata-rata\": p.mean(), \"Default rate aktual\": y.mean()})\n",
        "\n",
        "def psi(a, b, bins=10):                                             # a = acuan (development), b = pembanding\n",
        "    edges = np.unique(np.quantile(a, np.linspace(0, 1, bins + 1))); edges[[0, -1]] = -np.inf, np.inf\n",
        "    pa, pb = (np.clip(np.histogram(x, edges)[0] / len(x), 1e-6, None) for x in (a, b))\n",
        "    return ((pa - pb) * np.log(pa / pb)).sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "val = pd.DataFrame({k: validasi(y_val, p) for k, p in p_val.items()}).T\n",
        "val[\"AUC dev\"] = [roc_auc_score(y_dev, p_dev[k]) for k in val.index]\n",
        "val[\"PSI dev→val\"] = [psi(p_dev[k], p_val[k]) for k in val.index]\n",
        "coef = pd.Series(logit[-1].coef_[0], index=logit[1].get_feature_names_out(X_dev.columns)).sort_values(key=abs, ascending=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Cek logika: model jauh lebih baik dari acak, PSI dua sampel identik = 0\n",
        "assert (val.AUC > 0.75).all() and psi(p_dev[\"Logistik\"], p_dev[\"Logistik\"]) < 1e-9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "6141f3d6",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6141f3d6"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 3. Skor dan cutoff\n",
        "\n",
        "- **PD 12 bulan:** target mencakup 2 tahun, jadi PD₁₂ = 1 − (1 − PD₂)^½.\n",
        "- **Skor:** poin = 600 + 20/ln 2 × ln(odds / 50). Skor 600 berarti odds baik:buruk 50:1, dan setiap tambahan 20 poin menggandakan odds.\n",
        "- **Cutoff break-even:** pinjaman menguntungkan bila margin dari pinjaman baik menutup kerugian dari pinjaman buruk, margin × (1 − PD) ≥ PD × LGD. Jadi PD₁₂ break-even = margin / (margin + LGD) = 8% / 53% ≈ 15%.\n",
        "- Cutoff diuji pada sampel validation terhadap hasil **aktual**, jadi dampaknya terukur, bukan diasumsikan."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 4,
      "id": "b493a9bc",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.941366Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.940823Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.976183Z",
          "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.974479Z"
        },
        "id": "b493a9bc"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "port = pd.DataFrame({\"pd2\": p_val[\"Logistik\"], \"default\": y_val.to_numpy()})\n",
        "port[\"pd12\"] = 1 - (1 - port.pd2) ** 0.5\n",
        "factor = P[\"pdo\"] / np.log(2)\n",
        "skor = lambda p2: P[\"base_score\"] + factor * np.log((1 - p2) / p2 / P[\"base_odds\"])\n",
        "port[\"skor\"] = skor(port.pd2)\n",
        "\n",
        "pd_be = P[\"margin\"] / (P[\"margin\"] + P[\"lgd\"])                      # PD12 break-even\n",
        "cutoff = skor(1 - (1 - pd_be) ** 2)                                 # PD12 → PD 2 tahun → poin\n",
        "port[\"lolos\"] = port.skor >= cutoff\n",
        "\n",
        "# Default rate aktual per desil skor: bukti model mengurutkan risiko dengan benar\n",
        "port[\"desil\"] = pd.qcut(port.skor, 10, labels=range(1, 11))\n",
        "band = port.groupby(\"desil\", observed=True).agg(pd_prediksi=(\"pd2\", \"mean\"), default_aktual=(\"default\", \"mean\"))\n",
        "assert skor(0.01) > skor(0.2) and band.default_aktual.is_monotonic_decreasing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "12567353",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "12567353"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 4. Expected loss, Monte Carlo, dan stress test\n",
        "\n",
        "**Expected loss** per pinjaman adalah EL = PD₁₂ × LGD × EAD. Karena EAD sama, EL rate portofolio = rata-rata PD₁₂ × LGD.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Model Vasicek satu faktor.** Peminjam gagal bayar bila √ρ·Z + √(1−ρ)·ε < Φ⁻¹(PD), dengan Z faktor sistemik yang sama untuk seluruh ekonomi dan ε risiko khusus peminjam itu sendiri. Untuk nilai Z tertentu, default rate portofolio besar adalah\n",
        "\n",
        "PD(Z) = Φ( (Φ⁻¹(PD) − √ρ·Z) / √(1−ρ) )\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Monte Carlo:** 10.000 nilai Z ~ N(0, 1), setup yang sama dengan proyek LNG. Pinjaman dikelompokkan ke 50 bucket PD agar tiap skenario cukup satu perkalian matriks kecil.\n",
        "- **Cek:** pada model satu faktor, kerugian persentil 99 tepat sama dengan kerugian di Z = Φ⁻¹(1%), jadi VaR hasil simulasi harus cocok dengan rumus tertutup itu.\n",
        "- **Stress test:** kerugian pada nilai Z buruk yang ditetapkan: −1 (ringan, sekitar 1 dari 6 tahun), −2 (berat, 1 dari 44 tahun), dan −3 (ekstrem, 1 dari 740 tahun)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 5,
      "id": "9d17fc6e",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.981688Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-11T14:45:04.980864Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-11T14:45:05.286512Z",
          "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-11T14:45:05.285070Z"
        },
        "id": "9d17fc6e"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def buckets(book):                                                  # ringkas buku jadi 50 bucket PD\n",
        "    b = book.groupby(pd.qcut(book.pd12, 50, duplicates=\"drop\"), observed=True)\n",
        "    return b.pd12.mean().to_numpy(), b.size().to_numpy() / len(port)   # PD, porsi eksposur (vs portofolio awal)\n",
        "\n",
        "def loss(z, book):                                                  # rugi sebagai % portofolio untuk tiap nilai Z\n",
        "    pd_, w = buckets(book)\n",
        "    z, r = np.atleast_1d(z)[:, None], P[\"rho\"]\n",
        "    return norm.cdf((norm.ppf(pd_) - np.sqrt(r) * z) / np.sqrt(1 - r)) @ w * P[\"lgd\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "def metrics(c):\n",
        "    var = np.quantile(c, P[\"conf\"])\n",
        "    return pd.Series({\"EL\": c.mean(), \"VaR 99\": var, \"CVaR 99\": c[c >= var].mean(), \"UL = VaR − EL\": var - c.mean()})\n",
        "\n",
        "Z = np.random.default_rng(P[\"seed\"]).standard_normal(P[\"n_sims\"])   # seed sama → skenario sama untuk dua kebijakan\n",
        "lolos = port[port.lolos]\n",
        "L, L_cut = loss(Z, port), loss(Z, lolos)\n",
        "m = pd.DataFrame({\"Tanpa cutoff\": metrics(L), \"Dengan cutoff\": metrics(L_cut)})\n",
        "\n",
        "stres = pd.DataFrame({\"Z\": [0, -1, -2, -3]}, index=[\"Median\", \"Ringan\", \"Berat\", \"Ekstrem\"])\n",
        "stres[\"1 dari N tahun\"] = 1 / norm.cdf(stres.Z)\n",
        "stres[\"Rugi tanpa cutoff\"] = [loss(z, port).item() for z in stres.Z]\n",
        "stres[\"Rugi dengan cutoff\"] = [loss(z, lolos).item() for z in stres.Z]\n",
        "\n",
        "cut = pd.Series({\n",
        "    \"Approval rate\": port.lolos.mean(), \"Bad rate aktual, semua\": port.default.mean(),\n",
        "    \"Bad rate aktual, lolos\": lolos.default.mean(), \"Bad rate aktual, ditolak\": port[~port.lolos].default.mean(),\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "# KRI: (nilai, batas hijau, batas kuning); AUC dibalik tanda karena makin tinggi makin baik\n",
        "kri = pd.DataFrame([\n",
        "    (\"AUC model PD\",       val.AUC[\"Logistik\"],  0.75, 0.70, -1),   # batas umum validasi model\n",
        "    (\"Stabilitas skor (PSI)\", val[\"PSI dev→val\"][\"Logistik\"], 0.10, 0.25, 1),   # konvensi PSI industri\n",
        "    (\"VaR 99 tanpa cutoff\", m.loc[\"VaR 99\", \"Tanpa cutoff\"], 0.04, 0.06, 1),   # risk appetite (asumsi)\n",
        "], columns=[\"KRI\", \"nilai\", \"hijau\", \"kuning\", \"arah\"]).set_index(\"KRI\")\n",
        "kri[\"status\"] = [status(r.arah * r.nilai, r.arah * r.hijau, r.arah * r.kuning) for r in kri.itertuples()]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Cek: EL simulasi ≈ EL analitik, VaR simulasi ≈ rumus tertutup, cutoff menurunkan EL dan bad rate\n",
        "assert abs(m.loc[\"EL\", \"Tanpa cutoff\"] / (port.pd12.mean() * P[\"lgd\"]) - 1) < 0.02\n",
        "assert abs(m.loc[\"VaR 99\", \"Tanpa cutoff\"] / loss(norm.ppf(1 - P[\"conf\"]), port).item() - 1) < 0.03\n",
        "assert cut[\"Bad rate aktual, lolos\"] < cut[\"Bad rate aktual, semua\"] < cut[\"Bad rate aktual, ditolak\"]"
      ]
    },
